<Slide style={{ padding: '32px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'column',
    width: '100%',
    height: '100%',
    gap: 20,
  }}>
    {/* 页眉 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center',
      justifyContent: 'space-between',
      height: 40,
      borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8',
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>核心概念：Setting Specificity</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Core Concept</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 内容 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, height: 580 }}>
      {/* 左侧定义 */}
      <Box style={{
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 16,
        width: 520,
        paddingTop: 8,
      }}>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 10,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>什么是 Setting Specificity？</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            按数据收集意图对数据集分类：场景特定型（specific）聚焦单一操作环境，场景无关型（agnostic）覆盖多种日常场景。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#FFFFFF',
          border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 12,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>Setting-Specific</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            重复场景结构、一致视角、任务聚焦分类法。例如 Cityscapes、BDD100K（驾驶）。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#FFFFFF',
          border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 18,
          gap: 12,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>Setting-Agnostic</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            覆盖多场景、捕获条件变化大、标签空间更广。例如 COCO、Objects365。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          background: '#1E4FA8',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 16,
          marginTop: 4,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            人类研究验证：78 名参与者能稳定识别数据集场景签名（Yes/No 准确率 84.0%）
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    {/* 右侧：人类研究 Table 1 */}
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      gap: 12,
      paddingTop: 8,
    }}>
      <Box style={{
        background: '#F0F5FC',
        borderRadius: 8,
        padding: 14,
        gap: 6,
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>人类研究验证（Table 1）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          78 名参与者对 COCO / Cityscapes / Objects365 / BDD100K 图像进行场景一致性与来源判断，验证 Setting Specificity 的可感知性。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{
        flex: 1,
        border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
        borderRadius: 8,
        overflow: 'hidden',
      }}>
        <Table
          style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}
          defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 15, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
          defaultCellStyle={{
            padding: '8px 12px',
            border: {
              left: { width: 1, color: '#E8ECEF' },
              right: { width: 1, color: '#E8ECEF' },
              top: { width: 1, color: '#E8ECEF' },
              bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E8ECEF' },
            },
          }}
          cells={[
            // 表头
            [
              { text: 'Metric', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' }, width: 260 } },
              { text: 'Value', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'center' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
            ],
            // Likert 分组
            [
              { text: 'Likert responses', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0E3F8C' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8F0FA' } } },
              { text: '', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8F0FA' } } },
            ],
            ['Mean', { text: '4.83', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            ['Median [IQR]', { text: '4 [2, 8]', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            ['Accuracy (exact GT)', { text: '35.3%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            ['Agreement (within ±1 of GT)', { text: '65.4%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            // Yes/No 分组
            [
              { text: 'Yes/No responses', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0E3F8C' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8F0FA' } } },
              { text: '', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8F0FA' } } },
            ],
            ['Accuracy', { text: '84.0%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center', bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' } }],
            ['Accuracy (GT = Yes)', { text: '80.3%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            ['Accuracy (GT = No)', { text: '89.7%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
            ['Per-question accuracy range', { text: '66.2–98.7%', textStyle: { textAlign: 'center' } }],
          ]}
        />
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', textAlign: 'center' }}>
        来源：论文 Table 1 · Human study summary（n = 78）
      </Text>
    </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
